    "description": {
      "value": "You can pour this silver ooze into a lock or similar mechanism to create a set of malleable lockpicks and tools that conform to internal mechanisms. The ooze is treated as a set of thieves' tools that last for 1 hour and provide a +2 item bonus to Thievery checks to Pick Lock or Disable Device against the mechanism into which they were first poured.\n\nThe item bonus is +3, and the tools last for 8 hours.\n\nActivate (1 Action); Components Interact"
